(4191245, 602663, 78132, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2007-10-24 01:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191259, 603911, 84150, '<td valign="top">Would probably look cooler with a slower shutter speed.</td>', 'Would probably look cooler with a slower shutter speed.', '2007-10-24 01:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191281, 603320, 84150, '<td valign="top">looking down?</td>', 'looking down?', '2007-10-24 02:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191295, 602439, 84150, '<td valign="top">Wow, this kind of cool. I can''t tell whether you''re looking up or down.</td>', 'Wow, this kind of cool. I can''t tell whether you''re looking up or down.', '2007-10-24 02:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191334, 602758, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better if everything was in focus.  I especially don''t think that the little bit that is in focus should be in the center of the picture, that isn''t the most interesting part.</td>', 'I think this would look better if everything was in focus.  I especially don''t think that the little bit that is in focus should be in the center of the picture, that isn''t the most interesting part.', '2007-10-24 02:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191336, 602623, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, nice silhouette I really wish there was something to the sky, it is kind of bland.  Also if the flag was stretched out this would have a nicer appeal, nice idea though.</td>', 'This is a great shot, nice silhouette I really wish there was something to the sky, it is kind of bland.  Also if the flag was stretched out this would have a nicer appeal, nice idea though.', '2007-10-24 02:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191338, 603783, 85155, '<td valign="top">The hot spots and sun flare are a little distracting to me.  This is a unique shot though, I like the idea.</td>', 'The hot spots and sun flare are a little distracting to me.  This is a unique shot though, I like the idea.', '2007-10-24 02:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191341, 603962, 85155, '<td valign="top">The blue light coming from the window in the top of the picture takes my eyes away from the shot right away.  This is a really cool ceiling though.  I think I would have liked a shot that went up along that pillar more though.</td>', 'The blue light coming from the window in the top of the picture takes my eyes away from the shot right away.  This is a really cool ceiling though.  I think I would have liked a shot that went up along that pillar more though.', '2007-10-24 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191342, 603050, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nothing really seems to be in focus in this shot.</td>', 'Nothing really seems to be in focus in this shot.', '2007-10-24 02:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191345, 602906, 24976, '<td valign="top">lovely colors</td>', 'lovely colors', '2007-10-24 02:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191346, 603907, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice blue sky and framing with the trees.  I like this shot, and I can see it is from the ground''s perspective, but I would have liked a little more up in the shot.</td>', 'Nice blue sky and framing with the trees.  I like this shot, and I can see it is from the ground''s perspective, but I would have liked a little more up in the shot.', '2007-10-24 02:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191348, 602528, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting this shot at night.  I would like it if the clock was more in focus though, since that seems to be the focal point of the picture.  Also, because I can''t see what the building is standing on, it looks like it is just floating there.</td>', 'Nice job getting this shot at night.  I would like it if the clock was more in focus though, since that seems to be the focal point of the picture.  Also, because I can''t see what the building is standing on, it looks like it is just floating there.', '2007-10-24 02:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191351, 604141, 85155, '<td valign="top">I don''t really think this falls in line with the challenge, this is just a landscape picture at sunset.  I don''t really get the feeling that I am looking at this scene from the ground up.</td>', 'I don''t really think this falls in line with the challenge, this is just a landscape picture at sunset.  I don''t really get the feeling that I am looking at this scene from the ground up.', '2007-10-24 02:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191356, 602439, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot, the spirals really add to the overall appeal of the photo.  It took me a while to convince my brain I was looking up and not down, nice optical allusion.  The light on the floor right above you is kind of distracting in this photo though.</td>', 'This is a cool shot, the spirals really add to the overall appeal of the photo.  It took me a while to convince my brain I was looking up and not down, nice optical allusion.  The light on the floor right above you is kind of distracting in this photo though.', '2007-10-24 02:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191359, 603000, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the sky in this picture.  It is a well composed shot, but it doesn''t really have anything that just jumps out at me.</td>', 'I really like the sky in this picture.  It is a well composed shot, but it doesn''t really have anything that just jumps out at me.', '2007-10-24 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191362, 604037, 85155, '<td valign="top">It is hard to tell that this is from the ground looking up.  I really like the bokeh and the nice clear blue sky.  But I''m not sure that it completely fits within the challenge.</td>', 'It is hard to tell that this is from the ground looking up.  I really like the bokeh and the nice clear blue sky.  But I''m not sure that it completely fits within the challenge.', '2007-10-24 02:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191364, 602629, 85155, '<td valign="top">Try straightening this shot out, the orange/red seats kind of distract from the picture.  I like the overcast sky.</td>', 'Try straightening this shot out, the orange/red seats kind of distract from the picture.  I like the overcast sky.', '2007-10-24 02:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191365, 602077, 85155, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, I think the dog takes away from the picture though, I don''t know if I''m supposed to look at it or the driver.</td>', 'Interesting composition, I think the dog takes away from the picture though, I don''t know if I''m supposed to look at it or the driver.', '2007-10-24 02:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191367, 604116, 85155, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with the ground up?  I think it is a cool shot and I like how the cups are doing the framing, but I''m not sure it belongs in this challenge.</td>', 'What does this have to do with the ground up?  I think it is a cool shot and I like how the cups are doing the framing, but I''m not sure it belongs in this challenge.', '2007-10-24 02:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191369, 603712, 85155, '<td valign="top">What is the point of the person in this shot?  The subject is clearly the dog, the leash, shoe, and the rest of the person really distract in the shot.  Try cropping it down to just the dog.  If I didn''t know I was looking at pictures from the ground''s perspective I would have had no idea you were trying to do that here, I''m not sure it fits the challenge well.</td>', 'What is the point of the person in this shot?  The subject is clearly the dog, the leash, shoe, and the rest of the person really distract in the shot.  Try cropping it down to just the dog.  If I didn''t know I was looking at pictures from the ground''s perspective I would have had no idea you were trying to do that here, I''m not sure it fits the challenge well.', '2007-10-24 02:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191371, 604137, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w effect.  However, it is nice if the tractor has some room to move in the photo, here it looks like is running out of the frame.  Also it would be more interesting if the horizon was dead center in the shot, try moving it up or down, given the nature of the challenge, I would say move it down so we get more sky, giving us more of a feeling of the ground looking up.</td>', 'I like the b&w effect.  However, it is nice if the tractor has some room to move in the photo, here it looks like is running out of the frame.  Also it would be more interesting if the horizon was dead center in the shot, try moving it up or down, given the nature of the challenge, I would say move it down so we get more sky, giving us more of a feeling of the ground looking up.', '2007-10-24 02:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191372, 603820, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection of the other building here, it really adds to the interest of the picture.  It is really the best sunset, I would expect more since you titled it that, but I really like the picture anyway.</td>', 'I really like the reflection of the other building here, it really adds to the interest of the picture.  It is really the best sunset, I would expect more since you titled it that, but I really like the picture anyway.', '2007-10-24 02:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191373, 603578, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of the moon, it really brings out the detail.</td>', 'This is a nice shot of the moon, it really brings out the detail.', '2007-10-24 02:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191374, 604146, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot to me.  The old rusted car against that nice sky.  I like the composition a lot.</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot to me.  The old rusted car against that nice sky.  I like the composition a lot.', '2007-10-24 02:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191376, 603784, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice framing on the tower in the back.  The sky looks a little boring, too bad there weren''t a few clouds around.</td>', 'Nice framing on the tower in the back.  The sky looks a little boring, too bad there weren''t a few clouds around.', '2007-10-24 02:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191379, 604047, 85155, '<td valign="top">Is this really from the ground up?  I''m not sure that it completely fits in the challenge.</td>', 'Is this really from the ground up?  I''m not sure that it completely fits in the challenge.', '2007-10-24 02:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191380, 603957, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors, although I don''t really get the feeling of from the ground up.  And the sky is a little bland.  I think this shot would be better to just take the sky out, add some of the tree trunk instead maybe.</td>', 'Nice fall colors, although I don''t really get the feeling of from the ground up.  And the sky is a little bland.  I think this shot would be better to just take the sky out, add some of the tree trunk instead maybe.', '2007-10-24 02:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191381, 602869, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection of the sky in this building.  Good thing there were some clouds around, this is nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the reflection of the sky in this building.  Good thing there were some clouds around, this is nicely done.', '2007-10-24 02:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191383, 603336, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot is a little too dark for me.  The building kind of gets lost in the sky.  It looks like you were trying to get a silhouette effect, but I don''t think it works here, because the sky matches the building too much.</td>', 'This shot is a little too dark for me.  The building kind of gets lost in the sky.  It looks like you were trying to get a silhouette effect, but I don''t think it works here, because the sky matches the building too much.', '2007-10-24 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191384, 603994, 85155, '<td valign="top">This picture is too symmetrical for me.  It doesn''t really hold much interest.  I like the b&amp;w conversion, I wish the sky was a little more interesting though.  Try taking this at an angle maybe, instead of straight on.</td>', 'This picture is too symmetrical for me.  It doesn''t really hold much interest.  I like the b&w conversion, I wish the sky was a little more interesting though.  Try taking this at an angle maybe, instead of straight on.', '2007-10-24 02:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191387, 603278, 85155, '<td valign="top">The girl here is too dark.  I can''t really make out her face very well.  My eyes are drawn more to the clouds than to her.</td>', 'The girl here is too dark.  I can''t really make out her face very well.  My eyes are drawn more to the clouds than to her.', '2007-10-24 02:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191388, 603060, 85155, '<td valign="top">Is that a head stone in the top of the photo?  I would have had no idea without the title to help.  I think the main focus here is the tree anyway, try cropping that out and I think this would be better.  I really like the colors of the leaves, nicely done.</td>', 'Is that a head stone in the top of the photo?  I would have had no idea without the title to help.  I think the main focus here is the tree anyway, try cropping that out and I think this would be better.  I really like the colors of the leaves, nicely done.', '2007-10-24 02:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191389, 602005, 85155, '<td valign="top">This seems a little out of focus to me, if you are going to show the ground in the background make it be in focus, or just get rid of it.  I think this would be better without it.  I really like the light coming in through the roof, this is an interesting shot.</td>', 'This seems a little out of focus to me, if you are going to show the ground in the background make it be in focus, or just get rid of it.  I think this would be better without it.  I really like the light coming in through the roof, this is an interesting shot.', '2007-10-24 02:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191390, 603860, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the old building, and the long shadows along the wall.  This is a nice shot, it could only be better if the sky was a little darker, or maybe some clouds to help add interest.</td>', 'I really like the old building, and the long shadows along the wall.  This is a nice shot, it could only be better if the sky was a little darker, or maybe some clouds to help add interest.', '2007-10-24 02:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191391, 603686, 85155, '<td valign="top">This picture is too dark, I can''t really tell what I am looking at.</td>', 'This picture is too dark, I can''t really tell what I am looking at.', '2007-10-24 02:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191392, 603001, 85155, '<td valign="top">The ground is looking up at the shoes?  I don''t really get it, what are the people there for then?  I guess the bokeh is throwing me off a bit.</td>', 'The ground is looking up at the shoes?  I don''t really get it, what are the people there for then?  I guess the bokeh is throwing me off a bit.', '2007-10-24 02:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191395, 602649, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, a deeper blue in the sky would really help the color in the leaves stand out more though.  I also would have liked to see more of the tree, maybe part of the trunk.</td>', 'I like this shot, a deeper blue in the sky would really help the color in the leaves stand out more though.  I also would have liked to see more of the tree, maybe part of the trunk.', '2007-10-24 02:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191397, 603894, 85155, '<td valign="top">What is the dandelion planted in?  I can''t really see where it comes from, so it seems as though it is floating.  This would be better to me if I could see the ground.  Also watch out for the blown out portion in the bottom.</td>', 'What is the dandelion planted in?  I can''t really see where it comes from, so it seems as though it is floating.  This would be better to me if I could see the ground.  Also watch out for the blown out portion in the bottom.', '2007-10-24 02:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191399, 604105, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the different levels here.  This is a nicely composed photo.  I think it might be too dark on the bottom though.  I would like to be able to see what is there.</td>', 'I really like the different levels here.  This is a nicely composed photo.  I think it might be too dark on the bottom though.  I would like to be able to see what is there.', '2007-10-24 02:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191400, 603890, 85155, '<td valign="top">Wow, way to capture the movement of the wings here.  I really like the flag in the background too.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Wow, way to capture the movement of the wings here.  I really like the flag in the background too.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-24 02:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191402, 602053, 85155, '<td valign="top">Is this really the ground up, or just another fauna shot?</td>', 'Is this really the ground up, or just another fauna shot?', '2007-10-24 02:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191403, 603239, 85155, '<td valign="top">The sky is really boring in this shot.  Maybe bring the shot down so it doesn''t show as much of the sky, nice concept.</td>', 'The sky is really boring in this shot.  Maybe bring the shot down so it doesn''t show as much of the sky, nice concept.', '2007-10-24 02:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191406, 604038, 85155, '<td valign="top">Why is he so far down in the shot?  You have so much space at the top, try to move him up more, or just crop it off, you are cutting off the back of his foot even though you have plenty of space.</td>', 'Why is he so far down in the shot?  You have so much space at the top, try to move him up more, or just crop it off, you are cutting off the back of his foot even though you have plenty of space.', '2007-10-24 02:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191407, 601481, 85155, '<td valign="top">The top half of this shot is way too blown out.  It makes it hard to tell what I am even looking at.</td>', 'The top half of this shot is way too blown out.  It makes it hard to tell what I am even looking at.', '2007-10-24 02:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4191408, 603585, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here, I''m glad to see some of the tree trunks, and the sky coming through, they help to add to the color of the leaves.</td>', 'Nice shot here, I''m glad to see some of the tree trunks, and the sky coming through, they help to add to the color of the leaves.', '2007-10-24 02:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
