(4195294, 604139, 84887, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject and very well executed. One of my favorites in the challenge. I wish I could give you some constructive comments, but it is perfect in my mind.</td>', 'Great choice of subject and very well executed. One of my favorites in the challenge. I wish I could give you some constructive comments, but it is perfect in my mind.', '2007-10-25 15:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
