(4195313, 603817, 81382, '<td valign="top">I expected to see a lot of trees, and heres another one. Great sharpness though. I was about to say some fill light would be better but this actualy makes it cleaner and more dramatic</td>', 'I expected to see a lot of trees, and heres another one. Great sharpness though. I was about to say some fill light would be better but this actualy makes it cleaner and more dramatic', '2007-10-25 15:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
