(4195534, 602609, 58691, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of/through the sky ring. Keeping circle complete and buildings at a near-vertical perspective. I''ve seen this shot a number of times and those two issues usually plague the shot. Well done.  <br/> <br/>I wish you could''ve captured the Chevron Human Energy Poster that hangs on the inside. :)</td>', 'Nice shot of/through the sky ring. Keeping circle complete and buildings at a near-vertical perspective. I''ve seen this shot a number of times and those two issues usually plague the shot. Well done.   I wish you could''ve captured the Chevron Human Energy Poster that hangs on the inside. :)', '2007-10-25 17:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195560, 603939, 58691, '<td valign="top">The composition, lighting and contrast are all excellent. The sharp focus is a plus as well as the names and dates add additional interest. The shadows under the right side of her face add to the perception of sorrow. This is one of my favorites in this challenge. Well done.</td>', 'The composition, lighting and contrast are all excellent. The sharp focus is a plus as well as the names and dates add additional interest. The shadows under the right side of her face add to the perception of sorrow. This is one of my favorites in this challenge. Well done.', '2007-10-25 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
