(4201093, 603001, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, I am a wedding photographer myself so maybe I am looking at this from a wedding point of view and not a challenge point of view.. the idea is good, however the execution isnt so good. The bride looks VERY uncomfortable and not at all elegant, her position has pushed her tits right up into her face, its really isn''t classy.. however, it does fit the challenge and the exposure is nice, but as a wedding shot its not something I would be showing the B+G after they return from their honeymoon. 6</td>', 'OK, I am a wedding photographer myself so maybe I am looking at this from a wedding point of view and not a challenge point of view.. the idea is good, however the execution isnt so good. The bride looks VERY uncomfortable and not at all elegant, her position has pushed her tits right up into her face, its really isn''t classy.. however, it does fit the challenge and the exposure is nice, but as a wedding shot its not something I would be showing the B+G after they return from their honeymoon. 6', '2007-10-28 09:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
