(4204105, 604000, 64670, '<td valign="top">Something is astray with the exposure of this image.  I''m guessing it was handheld and that the light may have been against you.<br/> <br/>In situations such as this, it''s best to use a tripod and get your exposure correct.  As it stands now, the image is dark and less than sharp with is unpleasant.  I''m also not a big fan of putting things on an angle to add interest.  It can be done well, just not this time.</td>', 'Something is astray with the exposure of this image.  I''m guessing it was handheld and that the light may have been against you. In situations such as this, it''s best to use a tripod and get your exposure correct.  As it stands now, the image is dark and less than sharp with is unpleasant.  I''m also not a big fan of putting things on an angle to add interest.  It can be done well, just not this time.', '2007-10-29 16:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204110, 603911, 64670, '<td valign="top">Magic, MAGIC capture.  I just adore the B&amp;W - it brings out the metallic SO well.  Just WONDERFUL.<br/> <br/>Obviously my only (teeny gripe) is the nose being touching the bottom of the frame, but completely forgiven considering how amazing the rest of the image is!</td>', 'Magic, MAGIC capture.  I just adore the B&W - it brings out the metallic SO well.  Just WONDERFUL. Obviously my only (teeny gripe) is the nose being touching the bottom of the frame, but completely forgiven considering how amazing the rest of the image is!', '2007-10-29 16:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204112, 604058, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great sky colour.  However the remainder of the image lacks interest.</td>', 'Great sky colour.  However the remainder of the image lacks interest.', '2007-10-29 16:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204113, 603793, 64670, '<td valign="top">Fantastic suject and location, I ike ow the hammer mirrors the building''s panel of windows.<br/> <br/>However the image suffers because I suspect you didn''t use a tipod and was unuable to control the shake.</td>', 'Fantastic suject and location, I ike ow the hammer mirrors the building''s panel of windows. However the image suffers because I suspect you didn''t use a tipod and was unuable to control the shake.', '2007-10-29 16:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204114, 603686, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh WOWS - great capture.  This is a situation where having the subject lean works.<br/> <br/>I would LOVE to have seen what could have been achieved here with a more liberal set of challenge rules - in it''s own right it''s as grungy as can be - YIPPEE!</td>', 'Oh WOWS - great capture.  This is a situation where having the subject lean works. I would LOVE to have seen what could have been achieved here with a more liberal set of challenge rules - in it''s own right it''s as grungy as can be - YIPPEE!', '2007-10-29 16:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204116, 603920, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great subject for this image.  I love the two distinct colours and wide perspective.</td>', 'Great subject for this image.  I love the two distinct colours and wide perspective.', '2007-10-29 16:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204118, 603501, 64670, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the title is conveying - may be a cultural joke?  Anyway, this image is suffering from lack of lighting.  Much of the details are lost, and from the shake I can see I doubt you''ve used a tripod.</td>', 'Not sure what the title is conveying - may be a cultural joke?  Anyway, this image is suffering from lack of lighting.  Much of the details are lost, and from the shake I can see I doubt you''ve used a tripod.', '2007-10-29 16:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204122, 603908, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful tree.  I love the way the branch reaches out.  You''ve captured the whispyness well.  The image lacks great lighting (and sharpness) on the truck though.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful tree.  I love the way the branch reaches out.  You''ve captured the whispyness well.  The image lacks great lighting (and sharpness) on the truck though.', '2007-10-29 16:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204125, 602197, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great location and sky.  The image is rather flat though.  I''d have worked with selective colours (if you have photoshop) to bring out the blues and whites more.</td>', 'Great location and sky.  The image is rather flat though.  I''d have worked with selective colours (if you have photoshop) to bring out the blues and whites more.', '2007-10-29 16:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204126, 603584, 64670, '<td valign="top">The lighting was not your friend in this instance.  Too harsh on one side, to dark on the other.  Also the focal poin should have been the face, not the top of the pole.  Nice feathers though.</td>', 'The lighting was not your friend in this instance.  Too harsh on one side, to dark on the other.  Also the focal poin should have been the face, not the top of the pole.  Nice feathers though.', '2007-10-29 16:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204130, 603278, 64670, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the lighting is way off and the colours distorted byt he redish tinge.  I would have cropped the bottom 1/3 of the image, tried fill flash and worked to remove the red with selective colours (if you have photoshop)</td>', 'Good idea but the lighting is way off and the colours distorted byt he redish tinge.  I would have cropped the bottom 1/3 of the image, tried fill flash and worked to remove the red with selective colours (if you have photoshop)', '2007-10-29 16:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204133, 604106, 64670, '<td valign="top">The lighting was not your friend here.  In addition I''m guessing you may not have had the time to use your tripod, so we end up viewing a very blurry animal.</td>', 'The lighting was not your friend here.  In addition I''m guessing you may not have had the time to use your tripod, so we end up viewing a very blurry animal.', '2007-10-29 16:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204135, 604037, 64670, '<td valign="top">I see what you were aiming for, but the image is too flat.</td>', 'I see what you were aiming for, but the image is too flat.', '2007-10-29 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204136, 604087, 64670, '<td valign="top">It''s great you''ve fitted so much into this image, but the shake suggests to me that no tripod was used, which makes the image suffer.</td>', 'It''s great you''ve fitted so much into this image, but the shake suggests to me that no tripod was used, which makes the image suffer.', '2007-10-29 16:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204138, 602876, 64670, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours - well done.  Not fond of the angle you''ve chosen, feel you may have been more successful with the opposite end of the subject.</td>', 'Amazing colours - well done.  Not fond of the angle you''ve chosen, feel you may have been more successful with the opposite end of the subject.', '2007-10-29 16:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204147, 603612, 64670, '<td valign="top">A bit too much going on in this image.  The hydrant idea was cool, but the location is ''too busy''.  My eye can''t decide whether to be drawn to the moody sky, the flash of tail-lights or the building behind.  <br/> <br/>Also I''m wondering if hydrants in your country aren''t red?  If so this image would have done with a bit of a kick in the red department using selective colours (if you use photoshop)</td>', 'A bit too much going on in this image.  The hydrant idea was cool, but the location is ''too busy''.  My eye can''t decide whether to be drawn to the moody sky, the flash of tail-lights or the building behind.   Also I''m wondering if hydrants in your country aren''t red?  If so this image would have done with a bit of a kick in the red department using selective colours (if you use photoshop)', '2007-10-29 16:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204154, 602994, 64670, '<td valign="top">Amazing sharp crisp image.  A little disappointed that the image was cropped at the top to exclude the whole fresco in golds.  I guess you had to make a decision how much to fit in and you wanted the other end of the church in too.</td>', 'Amazing sharp crisp image.  A little disappointed that the image was cropped at the top to exclude the whole fresco in golds.  I guess you had to make a decision how much to fit in and you wanted the other end of the church in too.', '2007-10-29 16:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204156, 604021, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh YES!  Great image.  LOVE the leaf litter on the roof - love the framing and the hand - well ''of course!''</td>', 'Oh YES!  Great image.  LOVE the leaf litter on the roof - love the framing and the hand - well ''of course!''', '2007-10-29 16:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204161, 603000, 64670, '<td valign="top">Good perspective - lacks a bit of interest.  Too much of the clouds would have cropped some out as it detracts from the perspective of the building.</td>', 'Good perspective - lacks a bit of interest.  Too much of the clouds would have cropped some out as it detracts from the perspective of the building.', '2007-10-29 16:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204163, 603948, 64670, '<td valign="top">Interesting chimney, great sepia.  That thing in the image in the top corner is mighty distracting.</td>', 'Interesting chimney, great sepia.  That thing in the image in the top corner is mighty distracting.', '2007-10-29 16:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204169, 602077, 64670, '<td valign="top">The human or the dog?  Anyway - this would have been way more appealing if the focus was on the human''s face.  As it stands the wheel and the headlight is clear, but that''s just not something I care to see.  The blown out sky is disappointing too.</td>', 'The human or the dog?  Anyway - this would have been way more appealing if the focus was on the human''s face.  As it stands the wheel and the headlight is clear, but that''s just not something I care to see.  The blown out sky is disappointing too.', '2007-10-29 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
