(4204171, 604046, 64670, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have cropped out the red light.  The orange one is clear and attractive the red one, not so much.</td>', 'I think I''d have cropped out the red light.  The orange one is clear and attractive the red one, not so much.', '2007-10-29 16:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
