(4204900, 603147, 85849, '<td valign="top">The perspective is good. You must have been standing on something to be able to ballance all of that and still get the camera close enough. The sky is nice and blue. All of the colors are strong. I like the folds in the black shirt as well.</td>', 'The perspective is good. You must have been standing on something to be able to ballance all of that and still get the camera close enough. The sky is nice and blue. All of the colors are strong. I like the folds in the black shirt as well.', '2007-10-29 23:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204906, 602439, 85849, '<td valign="top">I like the concept as well as the symetry. It gives a bit of an optical illusion making it hard to telll exactly how high the lighthouse goes.</td>', 'I like the concept as well as the symetry. It gives a bit of an optical illusion making it hard to telll exactly how high the lighthouse goes.', '2007-10-29 23:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204914, 603304, 85849, '<td valign="top">Now that''s an interesting perspective of a tall building.</td>', 'Now that''s an interesting perspective of a tall building.', '2007-10-29 23:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204919, 602752, 85849, '<td valign="top">If not for the lamppost, it looks like it could be a view from space looking down on earth yet you know it''s from the ground looking up. The sky came out quite nice as well.</td>', 'If not for the lamppost, it looks like it could be a view from space looking down on earth yet you know it''s from the ground looking up. The sky came out quite nice as well.', '2007-10-30 00:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204924, 603336, 85849, '<td valign="top">The vantage point is definitely from the ground up. I like the perpective, but think it would have been better in color. In black and white, it looks more like a toy.</td>', 'The vantage point is definitely from the ground up. I like the perpective, but think it would have been better in color. In black and white, it looks more like a toy.', '2007-10-30 00:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204931, 603607, 85849, '<td valign="top">Not something you see every day. It looks like the building is being eaten by a green carpet. You wouldn''t get see as much detail with a steeper perspective, but that''s what I''m looking for. It becomes a little busy as well. I find my eyes don''t flow around the picture, they dart from place to place.</td>', 'Not something you see every day. It looks like the building is being eaten by a green carpet. You wouldn''t get see as much detail with a steeper perspective, but that''s what I''m looking for. It becomes a little busy as well. I find my eyes don''t flow around the picture, they dart from place to place.', '2007-10-30 00:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204938, 603720, 85849, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the tree is interesting. I think it could have been cropped differently. You look up the tree and off the picture to the right.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the tree is interesting. I think it could have been cropped differently. You look up the tree and off the picture to the right.', '2007-10-30 00:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204943, 604146, 85849, '<td valign="top">The car is very interesting and so is the sky. The car at the bottom has it grounded. I find my eyes look from the car, up to the left, back to the car, up to the middle, back to the car... The car is the anchor. I think it''s great! The grill and the hay in front adds character as well. I''d give it an 11 if I could.</td>', 'The car is very interesting and so is the sky. The car at the bottom has it grounded. I find my eyes look from the car, up to the left, back to the car, up to the middle, back to the car... The car is the anchor. I think it''s great! The grill and the hay in front adds character as well. I''d give it an 11 if I could.', '2007-10-30 00:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204949, 603206, 85849, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the title helps, but the sky is a nice blue. The balloon is detailed - I like the rope to the left. It''s too bad the flame couldn''t be seen. I took pictures at the Gatineau Balloon Festival 2007 and admit, you can only get the flame when it first starts. The crop is nice as weel. Your eyes move back to the balloon from any spot on the picture.</td>', 'I don''t think the title helps, but the sky is a nice blue. The balloon is detailed - I like the rope to the left. It''s too bad the flame couldn''t be seen. I took pictures at the Gatineau Balloon Festival 2007 and admit, you can only get the flame when it first starts. The crop is nice as weel. Your eyes move back to the balloon from any spot on the picture.', '2007-10-30 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204955, 602195, 85849, '<td valign="top">Even though there are so many leaves and branches, there is a symetry to it. There was an earlier shot of a tree that I didn''t bother voting on since the branches went in all directions and were more pronounced. That picture was too busy, and this one is quite nice.</td>', 'Even though there are so many leaves and branches, there is a symetry to it. There was an earlier shot of a tree that I didn''t bother voting on since the branches went in all directions and were more pronounced. That picture was too busy, and this one is quite nice.', '2007-10-30 00:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204961, 603913, 85849, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a neat idea! I like the depth of field leaving only the middle in sharp focus.</td>', 'Now that''s a neat idea! I like the depth of field leaving only the middle in sharp focus.', '2007-10-30 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204962, 603032, 85849, '<td valign="top">I started to think it was getting quite dark to the left, but the sky is so nice. I like the perspective and the texure.</td>', 'I started to think it was getting quite dark to the left, but the sky is so nice. I like the perspective and the texure.', '2007-10-30 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204967, 602003, 85849, '<td valign="top">Definitely from the ground up. I like the crop with the sky starting in the left corner. There is a symetry along that line and then you hit the other structure in the lower right. The sky breaks up almost like leaving a prism. What is that structure on the right anyway. It looks like aligator skin. Very surreal.</td>', 'Definitely from the ground up. I like the crop with the sky starting in the left corner. There is a symetry along that line and then you hit the other structure in the lower right. The sky breaks up almost like leaving a prism. What is that structure on the right anyway. It looks like aligator skin. Very surreal.', '2007-10-30 00:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204968, 603116, 85849, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The title is great! Lot''s toook at, but your eyes flow over it.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The title is great! Lot''s toook at, but your eyes flow over it.', '2007-10-30 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204972, 603874, 85849, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection shot. The colors are good and the mirrored building and the reflected buildings all meet the from the ground up theme.</td>', 'Nice reflection shot. The colors are good and the mirrored building and the reflected buildings all meet the from the ground up theme.', '2007-10-30 00:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205055, 603568, 30791, '<td valign="top">unique setting and well exposed. good luck</td>', 'unique setting and well exposed. good luck', '2007-10-30 02:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205057, 603585, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. Very nice image.</td>', 'Lovely colours. Very nice image.', '2007-10-30 02:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205058, 603665, 64670, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  My first thought is the shadown in the front left foreground draws my eye more than anything, which is not good, it seems to hold more attention than anything more in the image.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  My first thought is the shadown in the front left foreground draws my eye more than anything, which is not good, it seems to hold more attention than anything more in the image.', '2007-10-30 03:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205059, 602965, 64670, '<td valign="top">The sparkle in the horses eye is BRILLIANT.  The remainder of the image suffers a bit from the harsh lighting and shadows that creates, but that sparkle almost makes it worth it - GRIN!</td>', 'The sparkle in the horses eye is BRILLIANT.  The remainder of the image suffers a bit from the harsh lighting and shadows that creates, but that sparkle almost makes it worth it - GRIN!', '2007-10-30 03:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205060, 602904, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh WAY COOL!  Excellent image - I think this is inspired!</td>', 'Oh WAY COOL!  Excellent image - I think this is inspired!', '2007-10-30 03:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205063, 603539, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  The image itself is rather flat and lacks sharpness.  I think shadows/highlight work in post processing (if you have photoshop) would have assisted.</td>', 'Great perspective.  The image itself is rather flat and lacks sharpness.  I think shadows/highlight work in post processing (if you have photoshop) would have assisted.', '2007-10-30 03:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205067, 603658, 64670, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit off over the place.  The grapes may have been the subject of your image, but due to the leaves off to the left hand side, my eyes wander rather than appreciate your subject.  In addition the lighting has made it flat.</td>', 'The image is a bit off over the place.  The grapes may have been the subject of your image, but due to the leaves off to the left hand side, my eyes wander rather than appreciate your subject.  In addition the lighting has made it flat.', '2007-10-30 03:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
