(4205074, 603919, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely in it''s simplicity.  Although I would have liked the topmost stone to have been in focus more.</td>', 'Lovely in it''s simplicity.  Although I would have liked the topmost stone to have been in focus more.', '2007-10-30 03:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205078, 602602, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great shadow.  The man though is not so interesting.  I wonder if you could have moved around more to allow for the shadow to fall on or around the door more and then have the ability to crop the guy out.</td>', 'Great shadow.  The man though is not so interesting.  I wonder if you could have moved around more to allow for the shadow to fall on or around the door more and then have the ability to crop the guy out.', '2007-10-30 03:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205079, 604142, 64670, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful.  I really love the metallic look on the face.</td>', 'Just wonderful.  I really love the metallic look on the face.', '2007-10-30 03:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205081, 602294, 64670, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject matter, unfortunately I think the harshness of the light REALLY detracted from the image.  I think a tripod may have assisted to reduce blur too.</td>', 'Wonderful subject matter, unfortunately I think the harshness of the light REALLY detracted from the image.  I think a tripod may have assisted to reduce blur too.', '2007-10-30 03:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
