(4205751, 603772, 54778, '<td valign="top">the composition seems a little bland.. perhaps if the top of the tree was captured or a bunch of trees were captured together maybe the picture would have been improved..</td>', 'the composition seems a little bland.. perhaps if the top of the tree was captured or a bunch of trees were captured together maybe the picture would have been improved..', '2007-10-30 13:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205754, 603108, 54778, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow glow everywhere.. pretty pic..</td>', 'I like the yellow glow everywhere.. pretty pic..', '2007-10-30 13:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205780, 603860, 54778, '<td valign="top">The building is perfect for a picture.. As it is the picture lacks the balance between colours and textured grunge.. It seems lackluster because of the blandness of colours esp in the sky.. if you''d gone for the b/w grunge look then it could have been perfect esp. with the shadows or ladders.. if you could have gone closer then a more dramatic composition would have been possible..</td>', 'The building is perfect for a picture.. As it is the picture lacks the balance between colours and textured grunge.. It seems lackluster because of the blandness of colours esp in the sky.. if you''d gone for the b/w grunge look then it could have been perfect esp. with the shadows or ladders.. if you could have gone closer then a more dramatic composition would have been possible..', '2007-10-30 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205784, 603991, 54778, '<td valign="top">I think the focus should have landed somewhere in the middle.. then the texture and delicatness of the mushroom would have come out..</td>', 'I think the focus should have landed somewhere in the middle.. then the texture and delicatness of the mushroom would have come out..', '2007-10-30 13:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205802, 602776, 86056, '<td valign="top">i love the colors.</td>', 'i love the colors.', '2007-10-30 13:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205815, 602439, 72296, '<td valign="top">It''s an easy shot in terms of composition, but you''ve done well with the light here.</td>', 'It''s an easy shot in terms of composition, but you''ve done well with the light here.', '2007-10-30 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205826, 602197, 72296, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer if the horizontal line were straight, and not on an angle. Also, including more of the building to have a more dramatic shift "up" would give it more punch.</td>', 'I''d prefer if the horizontal line were straight, and not on an angle. Also, including more of the building to have a more dramatic shift "up" would give it more punch.', '2007-10-30 13:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205828, 603336, 72296, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. I really like it. Would be nice if the building were just a little brighter, but the composition is great.</td>', 'Nice and simple. I really like it. Would be nice if the building were just a little brighter, but the composition is great.', '2007-10-30 13:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205829, 604137, 39679, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot but I''m note getting the challenge from it.</td>', 'Beautiful shot but I''m note getting the challenge from it.', '2007-10-30 13:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205832, 603060, 72296, '<td valign="top">This is too dark to read the headstone -- makes it hard to see what it is.</td>', 'This is too dark to read the headstone -- makes it hard to see what it is.', '2007-10-30 13:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205835, 603919, 72296, '<td valign="top">Really nice lighting, and I love the depth of field.</td>', 'Really nice lighting, and I love the depth of field.', '2007-10-30 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205841, 603568, 72296, '<td valign="top">Neat place. I would love to see the hole in the rock ceiling more clearly (i.e. take the picture from higher up on the stairs to cut out some of the black on the base of the photo) but it''s certainly interesting.</td>', 'Neat place. I would love to see the hole in the rock ceiling more clearly (i.e. take the picture from higher up on the stairs to cut out some of the black on the base of the photo) but it''s certainly interesting.', '2007-10-30 14:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205849, 602003, 72296, '<td valign="top">It''s an easy shot, but the composition is good. I like the reflection in the windows. Makes the one building look hollow.</td>', 'It''s an easy shot, but the composition is good. I like the reflection in the windows. Makes the one building look hollow.', '2007-10-30 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205850, 603910, 72296, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2007-10-30 14:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205853, 603108, 72296, '<td valign="top">All right, it''s an easy shot but it looks pretty gorgeous!</td>', 'All right, it''s an easy shot but it looks pretty gorgeous!', '2007-10-30 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205855, 603783, 72296, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2007-10-30 14:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205857, 603306, 72296, '<td valign="top">The bottom of your photo is lost in darkness. Would love to see the detail.</td>', 'The bottom of your photo is lost in darkness. Would love to see the detail.', '2007-10-30 14:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205858, 603836, 72296, '<td valign="top">How is this "From The Ground Up"?</td>', 'How is this "From The Ground Up"?', '2007-10-30 14:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205859, 603872, 72296, '<td valign="top">The detail is amazing. Why are there no other stars in the picture, though? Did you ''shop them out?</td>', 'The detail is amazing. Why are there no other stars in the picture, though? Did you ''shop them out?', '2007-10-30 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205861, 602716, 72296, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry.</td>', 'Nice symmetry.', '2007-10-30 14:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205863, 602308, 72296, '<td valign="top">With the haze and the vagely pink and green lighting, it looks almost like something from a Tim Burton flick.</td>', 'With the haze and the vagely pink and green lighting, it looks almost like something from a Tim Burton flick.', '2007-10-30 14:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205864, 604096, 72296, '<td valign="top">This looks so soft and hazy. Did you use a filter?</td>', 'This looks so soft and hazy. Did you use a filter?', '2007-10-30 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205865, 603226, 72296, '<td valign="top">Last view of the newly departed?</td>', 'Last view of the newly departed?', '2007-10-30 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205866, 604148, 72296, '<td valign="top">The color is amazing here.</td>', 'The color is amazing here.', '2007-10-30 14:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205868, 604000, 72296, '<td valign="top">I hate the green cast.</td>', 'I hate the green cast.', '2007-10-30 14:14:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4205870, 603861, 72296, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective! Glad he didn''t fall on your camera.</td>', 'Nice perspective! Glad he didn''t fall on your camera.', '2007-10-30 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205923, 604101, 72296, '<td valign="top">Great color, great composition. Very unique for the challenge.</td>', 'Great color, great composition. Very unique for the challenge.', '2007-10-30 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205944, 603619, 72296, '<td valign="top">The lighthouse looks pixelated.</td>', 'The lighthouse looks pixelated.', '2007-10-30 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205948, 604021, 72296, '<td valign="top">With all the black scattered on the shot, it''s hard to see the hand. Would be nice if it were larger for more impact.</td>', 'With all the black scattered on the shot, it''s hard to see the hand. Would be nice if it were larger for more impact.', '2007-10-30 14:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205950, 604134, 72296, '<td valign="top">How is this "From The Ground Up" ?</td>', 'How is this "From The Ground Up" ?', '2007-10-30 15:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205951, 603001, 72296, '<td valign="top">How is this From The Ground Up? It''s a shoe and a couple.</td>', 'How is this From The Ground Up? It''s a shoe and a couple.', '2007-10-30 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205952, 603940, 72296, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2007-10-30 15:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205953, 602528, 72296, '<td valign="top">Too dark to see the carving on the building.</td>', 'Too dark to see the carving on the building.', '2007-10-30 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205955, 603663, 72296, '<td valign="top">Wow. The detail and clarity is amazing here. Were you using a Hasselblad?</td>', 'Wow. The detail and clarity is amazing here. Were you using a Hasselblad?', '2007-10-30 15:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205957, 602623, 72296, '<td valign="top">Love the high contrast, and how the flagpole almost disappears.</td>', 'Love the high contrast, and how the flagpole almost disappears.', '2007-10-30 15:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206134, 604119, 69684, '<td valign="top">I like the plane! Could use some more contrast, but it''s still very nice.</td>', 'I like the plane! Could use some more contrast, but it''s still very nice.', '2007-10-30 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206208, 604029, 85849, '<td valign="top">very surreal.</td>', 'very surreal.', '2007-10-30 17:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206216, 603994, 85849, '<td valign="top">Very powerful</td>', 'Very powerful', '2007-10-30 17:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206226, 602869, 85849, '<td valign="top">Nice sky. Simple, but keeps you eyes moving around the picture.</td>', 'Nice sky. Simple, but keeps you eyes moving around the picture.', '2007-10-30 17:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206231, 602766, 85849, '<td valign="top">It would be more interesting if I could tell that the plant was still in the ground. Nice perspective if it is.</td>', 'It would be more interesting if I could tell that the plant was still in the ground. Nice perspective if it is.', '2007-10-30 17:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206240, 603912, 85849, '<td valign="top">A different version of from the ground up. The focus is on the bee at ground level, but moving up the picture you follow the trees and the cloud to the right keeps your eye from leaving. I would give this an 11 if I could.</td>', 'A different version of from the ground up. The focus is on the bee at ground level, but moving up the picture you follow the trees and the cloud to the right keeps your eye from leaving. I would give this an 11 if I could.', '2007-10-30 17:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206249, 604141, 85849, '<td valign="top">Another unique perspective - not just looking up the side of a building. There''s so much to look at, but it''s not busy. Somebody shoot the guy for leaving the jet trail up there. Nice shot!</td>', 'Another unique perspective - not just looking up the side of a building. There''s so much to look at, but it''s not busy. Somebody shoot the guy for leaving the jet trail up there. Nice shot!', '2007-10-30 17:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206262, 604038, 85849, '<td valign="top">The lack of clouds is kinda neat and unusual. You want to look at this for a bit of time to get a sense of what it is. He appears to be looking somewhere far off.</td>', 'The lack of clouds is kinda neat and unusual. You want to look at this for a bit of time to get a sense of what it is. He appears to be looking somewhere far off.', '2007-10-30 18:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206267, 602521, 85849, '<td valign="top">I find this tree busy. The picture is quite dark. The birdhouse is the most interesting part, but you notice it last.</td>', 'I find this tree busy. The picture is quite dark. The birdhouse is the most interesting part, but you notice it last.', '2007-10-30 18:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206279, 602528, 85849, '<td valign="top">The perspective seems right, but the picture is quite dark. I may be missing the point because it does make me look at it for some time, but it seems more to find detail of what I''m looking at.</td>', 'The perspective seems right, but the picture is quite dark. I may be missing the point because it does make me look at it for some time, but it seems more to find detail of what I''m looking at.', '2007-10-30 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206293, 603990, 85849, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting and keeps your eyes on the picture. The perspective is good. I like the picture, but find others with more interest. I can''t say it''s not unique, it is.</td>', 'It''s interesting and keeps your eyes on the picture. The perspective is good. I like the picture, but find others with more interest. I can''t say it''s not unique, it is.', '2007-10-30 18:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206305, 602609, 85849, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the sky. The circular opening really keeps your eyes on the picture. This is actually quite a cool picture. I like it more the longer I look at it. I''ve got to regroup my rating system. This is the third out of 45 I''ve wanted to give an 11!</td>', 'I like the color and the sky. The circular opening really keeps your eyes on the picture. This is actually quite a cool picture. I like it more the longer I look at it. I''ve got to regroup my rating system. This is the third out of 45 I''ve wanted to give an 11!', '2007-10-30 18:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206331, 603940, 75034, '<td valign="top">Now this is what I was thinking this challenge should have in it. Nice job on the capture. Do you set for a long exposure on a shot like this or is it just a 1-5 sec shot? I like the colours and the prospective on the shot. It is a beautiful place to be for you to get a photo like this. I to would love to capture such a shot. Good on you.</td>', 'Now this is what I was thinking this challenge should have in it. Nice job on the capture. Do you set for a long exposure on a shot like this or is it just a 1-5 sec shot? I like the colours and the prospective on the shot. It is a beautiful place to be for you to get a photo like this. I to would love to capture such a shot. Good on you.', '2007-10-30 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206349, 603686, 75034, '<td valign="top">Your image is quite dark on my monitor and as a result a lot of the wonderful details are gone for me. The angle is interesting and the composition works but I think I would need to see a lighter vewrsion to fully appreciate your photo.</td>', 'Your image is quite dark on my monitor and as a result a lot of the wonderful details are gone for me. The angle is interesting and the composition works but I think I would need to see a lighter vewrsion to fully appreciate your photo.', '2007-10-30 18:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206358, 601735, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is a true from the ground up shot, but I think I would like to see a little more contrast and maybe a bit darker in the middle because I see it a little blown out on my monitor.</td>', 'This is a true from the ground up shot, but I think I would like to see a little more contrast and maybe a bit darker in the middle because I see it a little blown out on my monitor.', '2007-10-30 18:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206364, 603381, 75034, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and crisp image, the DoF works great and the stopped motion on the props is awsome. Great shot.</td>', 'Wonderful and crisp image, the DoF works great and the stopped motion on the props is awsome. Great shot.', '2007-10-30 18:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206377, 602077, 80096, '<td valign="top">Dirty truck, pretty girl. 7</td>', 'Dirty truck, pretty girl. 7', '2007-10-30 18:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206390, 603368, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is a cool take on this challenge and I hope it does you well. I like the coulor contrast and the crop. I don''t think we would be served well by seeing any more of the goings on, it might make it to busy. Good on you for thinking outside the box.</td>', 'This is a cool take on this challenge and I hope it does you well. I like the coulor contrast and the crop. I don''t think we would be served well by seeing any more of the goings on, it might make it to busy. Good on you for thinking outside the box.', '2007-10-30 18:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206418, 602675, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for this challenge, I think it fits in ok but I fear many others might not. I like the angle of the shot and the B&amp;W conversion. The shot is nice and sharp and I like the reflections on the car. My uncle Don has 7 original E-type Jaguars and about 5 more in his parts barn that he has collected over the years.</td>', 'Nice concept for this challenge, I think it fits in ok but I fear many others might not. I like the angle of the shot and the B&W conversion. The shot is nice and sharp and I like the reflections on the car. My uncle Don has 7 original E-type Jaguars and about 5 more in his parts barn that he has collected over the years.', '2007-10-30 19:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206422, 603793, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice details and the lighting works well here. Do you work for the construction compant or did you happen on this one Saturday and creep into the hole when no one was watching?</td>', 'Nice details and the lighting works well here. Do you work for the construction compant or did you happen on this one Saturday and creep into the hole when no one was watching?', '2007-10-30 19:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206427, 604101, 86072, '<td valign="top">Amazing reflections. The soft focus looks a bit harsh but otherwise a truly spectacular shot.</td>', 'Amazing reflections. The soft focus looks a bit harsh but otherwise a truly spectacular shot.', '2007-10-30 19:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206431, 603619, 68546, '<td valign="top">Awesome colours and composition. Such a simple and yet stunning image</td>', 'Awesome colours and composition. Such a simple and yet stunning image', '2007-10-30 19:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206436, 603910, 68546, '<td valign="top">Very nice, it''s an interesting building at any time but with this lighting you''ve caught it really well.</td>', 'Very nice, it''s an interesting building at any time but with this lighting you''ve caught it really well.', '2007-10-30 19:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206438, 602758, 75034, '<td valign="top">I find your blur to be distracting and your focal point to be pointless. I thikn you have a lot to work with here and could try this again from a better angle. The lighting is good and the colour is fine, I just feel that this will not appeal to many in this challenge becaues it lacks so many things that make an image show well in challenges.</td>', 'I find your blur to be distracting and your focal point to be pointless. I thikn you have a lot to work with here and could try this again from a better angle. The lighting is good and the colour is fine, I just feel that this will not appeal to many in this challenge becaues it lacks so many things that make an image show well in challenges.', '2007-10-30 19:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206440, 603108, 68546, '<td valign="top">stunning, great exposure with the bright sun in the shot. Excellent colours and just enough of a foreground to make the composition work</td>', 'stunning, great exposure with the bright sun in the shot. Excellent colours and just enough of a foreground to make the composition work', '2007-10-30 19:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206443, 602113, 68546, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W conversion, a superb image</td>', 'Very nice B&W conversion, a superb image', '2007-10-30 19:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206445, 603320, 75034, '<td valign="top">ic, I think you might just be a little to clever for me with this. I''ll have to come back to it after the challenge and read your discription to find out what you were up to.</td>', 'ic, I think you might just be a little to clever for me with this. I''ll have to come back to it after the challenge and read your discription to find out what you were up to.', '2007-10-30 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206447, 604029, 68546, '<td valign="top">very nice sky, good B&amp;W tones</td>', 'very nice sky, good B&W tones', '2007-10-30 19:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206456, 603247, 68546, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a little fake in this shot, a little too dark for the rest of the lighting. I''m not sure about the lighting on the face as well, the shadow of the hair on the face is a little distracting. Nice composition though and a good concept for the challenge</td>', 'The sky looks a little fake in this shot, a little too dark for the rest of the lighting. I''m not sure about the lighting on the face as well, the shadow of the hair on the face is a little distracting. Nice composition though and a good concept for the challenge', '2007-10-30 19:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206458, 602937, 75034, '<td valign="top">Not quite what I thought I would see in this challenge. Not that I''m a professional (you only have to look in my portfolio to see that) but don''t you think your a little of base with your entry. Purhaps you were trying something new and is is beyond me alltogether. Sorry if I don''t get it, I''ll look after the challenge to read your discription on your shot.</td>', 'Not quite what I thought I would see in this challenge. Not that I''m a professional (you only have to look in my portfolio to see that) but don''t you think your a little of base with your entry. Purhaps you were trying something new and is is beyond me alltogether. Sorry if I don''t get it, I''ll look after the challenge to read your discription on your shot.', '2007-10-30 19:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206643, 602906, 3746, '<td valign="top">Amazing quality of light, maybe the greens are a tad oversaturated? Hope this does well.. 8</td>', 'Amazing quality of light, maybe the greens are a tad oversaturated? Hope this does well.. 8', '2007-10-30 21:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206646, 603568, 74406, '<td valign="top">cool!</td>', 'cool!', '2007-10-30 21:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206670, 603147, 19952, '<td valign="top">I am *totally* stealing this idea! :-) This is a great complement to the juggling photo and will hopefully end up on a billboard as well. Good luck!</td>', 'I am *totally* stealing this idea! :-) This is a great complement to the juggling photo and will hopefully end up on a billboard as well. Good luck!', '2007-10-30 21:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206671, 603116, 75034, '<td valign="top">this is one illustration of the challenge outline and I have to say allthough it meets it lierally it will be a hard sell for some people and they will wonder why you entered a building. The right side of your image is a little blown out as is the windows. You could desaturate a bit to clear that up.</td>', 'this is one illustration of the challenge outline and I have to say allthough it meets it lierally it will be a hard sell for some people and they will wonder why you entered a building. The right side of your image is a little blown out as is the windows. You could desaturate a bit to clear that up.', '2007-10-30 21:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206676, 602882, 75034, '<td valign="top">Did you intend to have yourself out of focus? Overall I like the composition and the use of B&amp;W but the right side is blown out and takes away from the shot.</td>', 'Did you intend to have yourself out of focus? Overall I like the composition and the use of B&W but the right side is blown out and takes away from the shot.', '2007-10-30 21:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206682, 603836, 75034, '<td valign="top">Your image is a little over saturated and could stand to be toned down a bit. The owl is beautiful but I wonder how well it suits this challenge, unless you are refering to the fact that the owl can fly. I''ll look in the discription after the challenge to find out.</td>', 'Your image is a little over saturated and could stand to be toned down a bit. The owl is beautiful but I wonder how well it suits this challenge, unless you are refering to the fact that the owl can fly. I''ll look in the discription after the challenge to find out.', '2007-10-30 21:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206688, 603239, 75034, '<td valign="top">Ok I get, your on the ground and you took the shot pointing the camera up, right? Anyho, the overall shot is good and the B&amp;W conversion is nice. I like the freeze frame on the action.</td>', 'Ok I get, your on the ground and you took the shot pointing the camera up, right? Anyho, the overall shot is good and the B&W conversion is nice. I like the freeze frame on the action.', '2007-10-30 21:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206690, 603226, 67174, '<td valign="top">I love the POV. May have been better if it was a longer image to possibly see the rest of her legs (the one on the right) or more faces?</td>', 'I love the POV. May have been better if it was a longer image to possibly see the rest of her legs (the one on the right) or more faces?', '2007-10-30 21:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206692, 603861, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is a different approach to this challenge and I like the look and feel of the shot. This works well in B&amp;W and I think it should hold up well here. Best of luck.</td>', 'This is a different approach to this challenge and I like the look and feel of the shot. This works well in B&W and I think it should hold up well here. Best of luck.', '2007-10-30 21:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206696, 603877, 67174, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, not fond of the negative space in between the building though (not like you can help it lol). REALLY like the reflection.</td>', 'I like the idea, not fond of the negative space in between the building though (not like you can help it lol). REALLY like the reflection.', '2007-10-30 21:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206700, 603359, 75034, '<td valign="top">This would make a great callender shot. I love the light and the roll of the tide. The sky looks like there was a storm coming in. I think that the edit you made was just the right tones and not over done. This should do well, best of luck.</td>', 'This would make a great callender shot. I love the light and the roll of the tide. The sky looks like there was a storm coming in. I think that the edit you made was just the right tones and not over done. This should do well, best of luck.', '2007-10-30 21:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206705, 603665, 75034, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful crisp day there. I like the colours and tones in your shot.</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful crisp day there. I like the colours and tones in your shot.', '2007-10-30 21:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206712, 603784, 75034, '<td valign="top">This plays well. From the doorway to the window to the sky. I like the DoF and the texture in your shot. The all blue sky in a nice frame from your shot.</td>', 'This plays well. From the doorway to the window to the sky. I like the DoF and the texture in your shot. The all blue sky in a nice frame from your shot.', '2007-10-30 22:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
