(4207035, 603568, 63700, '<td valign="top">If I could have stayed down there all day, I would have. It was a 1hr. Tour through the cave, with groups coming through every 10-15min.  I only had time to get off about 5 shots in the Cathedral Room, but luckily I''ve been in the cave before, so I had some ideas of what I wanted.  Needless to say, I was the only person in our group that had a tripod.  I wanted to take the tour again....but ran out of time.</td>', 'If I could have stayed down there all day, I would have. It was a 1hr. Tour through the cave, with groups coming through every 10-15min.  I only had time to get off about 5 shots in the Cathedral Room, but luckily I''ve been in the cave before, so I had some ideas of what I wanted.  Needless to say, I was the only person in our group that had a tripod.  I wanted to take the tour again....but ran out of time.', '2007-10-31 00:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
