(4207163, 602113, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well, congratulations, Jeb!! All your worrying was for naught -- 7th place with a "top 10 star" is something to be proud of. This is a wonderful image -- very spooky and appropriate for this season. And look at all those 8s, 9s, and 10s.</td>', 'Well, congratulations, Jeb!! All your worrying was for naught -- 7th place with a "top 10 star" is something to be proud of. This is a wonderful image -- very spooky and appropriate for this season. And look at all those 8s, 9s, and 10s.', '2007-10-31 00:38:30.000000', NULL, 0),
