(4207767, 603872, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really nice Moon shot - I quite liked it and the details you were able to capture of the moon surface.  I am surprised that more commenters liked mine more than yours - I really thought yours was the better image.</td>', 'Really nice Moon shot - I quite liked it and the details you were able to capture of the moon surface.  I am surprised that more commenters liked mine more than yours - I really thought yours was the better image.', '2007-10-31 07:24:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4207775, 603179, 36616, '<td valign="top">You got the technical side ok.<br/> <br/>A good pic needs to lead the viewers eye into the picture. This shot blocks out the middle so you do not follow the water up the building to the tower. If you can, try taking the shot from the higher level and see if it has more interest. Possibly try a night shot.<br/> <br/>From someone who has learned a lot from this site - keep on trying, listening and you will improve. Good luck.<br/>John</td>', 'You got the technical side ok. A good pic needs to lead the viewers eye into the picture. This shot blocks out the middle so you do not follow the water up the building to the tower. If you can, try taking the shot from the higher level and see if it has more interest. Possibly try a night shot. From someone who has learned a lot from this site - keep on trying, listening and you will improve. Good luck.John', '2007-10-31 07:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
