(4211292, 603793, 63398, '<td valign="top">I *still* think this is a better offering than mine! Seriously underrated and underscored. I was totally impressed with the angle and perspective and the fact that you both managed to actually capture the entire machine in the image, and still convey the enormous size of it. VERY well done IMO.</td>', 'I *still* think this is a better offering than mine! Seriously underrated and underscored. I was totally impressed with the angle and perspective and the fact that you both managed to actually capture the entire machine in the image, and still convey the enormous size of it. VERY well done IMO.', '2007-11-01 07:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
