(4211742, 602351, 63398, '<td valign="top">Okay......bear with me, I''m trying to learn how to leave carefully constructive comments. The contrast between the entire structure being visible *except* the way that the guardian is shrouded in shadow is disconcerting to me. I would like to see more definition on the guardian, or less on the steeple/tower. Perhaps angled as someone else suggested, or perhaps less of the steeple/tower below it. I agree that the colors seem a tad off.</td>', 'Okay......bear with me, I''m trying to learn how to leave carefully constructive comments. The contrast between the entire structure being visible *except* the way that the guardian is shrouded in shadow is disconcerting to me. I would like to see more definition on the guardian, or less on the steeple/tower. Perhaps angled as someone else suggested, or perhaps less of the steeple/tower below it. I agree that the colors seem a tad off.', '2007-11-01 10:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4211756, 603817, 63398, '<td valign="top">A good "From the Ground Up" concept, but just a tad unexciting for me.....I saw too many tree shots in this challenge. Tree shots had to be off the charts good to inspire me at all after a while. I really like the title!</td>', 'A good "From the Ground Up" concept, but just a tad unexciting for me.....I saw too many tree shots in this challenge. Tree shots had to be off the charts good to inspire me at all after a while. I really like the title!', '2007-11-01 10:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
