(4212358, 603794, 82814, '<td valign="top">Hey Randy, Congratulations on your placement in the top 20!  A 6.35 overall average is a great rating.  It''s a wonderful shot!  Cheers, Sandra.</td>', 'Hey Randy, Congratulations on your placement in the top 20!  A 6.35 overall average is a great rating.  It''s a wonderful shot!  Cheers, Sandra.', '2007-11-01 13:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
