(4216168, 604029, 68035, '<td valign="top">Alicia.<br/> <br/>That bell tower is serving you well, two 6+''s and front pages in a week.  It is quite nice to be able to compare the two, although I think I do prefer the colour one simply for the extraordinary PP job you did on it<br/> <br/>Love the cloud pattern on the top right of the frame, it looks like an opening into another world</td>', 'Alicia. That bell tower is serving you well, two 6+''s and front pages in a week.  It is quite nice to be able to compare the two, although I think I do prefer the colour one simply for the extraordinary PP job you did on it Love the cloud pattern on the top right of the frame, it looks like an opening into another world', '2007-11-02 15:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4216205, 603578, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter<br/> <br/>I love moon shots, and this is a real classic of the genre.  Certainly I would be mightily hacked off if I had taken it and it had scored less than a 6.  It may simply be that there have been quite a few in recent weeks and people are getting a bit blase about what is a beautiful subject fantastically executed</td>', 'Peter I love moon shots, and this is a real classic of the genre.  Certainly I would be mightily hacked off if I had taken it and it had scored less than a 6.  It may simply be that there have been quite a few in recent weeks and people are getting a bit blase about what is a beautiful subject fantastically executed', '2007-11-02 15:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4216209, 603578, 48928, '<td valign="top">5.9?   Hmmm... that''s not right.  VERY good shot, sometime DPC voters REALLLLLY make me wonder.  Keep up the great work.</td>', '5.9?   Hmmm... that''s not right.  VERY good shot, sometime DPC voters REALLLLLY make me wonder.  Keep up the great work.', '2007-11-02 15:56:10.000000', NULL, 0),
