(4268388, 604137, 14614, '<td valign="top">for me this is all about texture and repeating strip patterns since the horizon line cuts the center balancing the composition with strips.  B&amp;W treatment really works as now it''s all about the ground up.  didn''t vote in this contest but would have scored it high.</td>', 'for me this is all about texture and repeating strip patterns since the horizon line cuts the center balancing the composition with strips.  B&W treatment really works as now it''s all about the ground up.  didn''t vote in this contest but would have scored it high.', '2007-11-25 18:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4278342, 602113, 30049, '<td valign="top">You did a really nice job with this.  When I first looked at it I thought it may have been the Scooby-Doo tower at King''s Dominion here in Virginia (used it for a reflections challenge).   Obviously it''s not.  :-D<br/> <br/>This location would make a great shot for a Halloween challenge too!  Of course, you''d need that dramatic sky to cooperate again.  :-P</td>', 'You did a really nice job with this.  When I first looked at it I thought it may have been the Scooby-Doo tower at King''s Dominion here in Virginia (used it for a reflections challenge).   Obviously it''s not.  :-D This location would make a great shot for a Halloween challenge too!  Of course, you''d need that dramatic sky to cooperate again.  :-P', '2007-11-30 13:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
