(4840909, 603802, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really love those purplish-pink zig-zags around the center.  Kind of reminds me of silk dress fabric.  Great find.  I don''t think I would ever have figured out what it was unless you told me.<br/> <br/>FWIW, great minds run in similar paths.  Here''s one I did awhile ago.  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=656691" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35545/120/656691.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35545/120/656691.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35545/120/656691.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I really love those purplish-pink zig-zags around the center.  Kind of reminds me of silk dress fabric.  Great find.  I don''t think I would ever have figured out what it was unless you told me. FWIW, great minds run in similar paths.  Here''s one I did awhile ago.    ', '2008-07-23 12:04:32.000000', NULL, 0),
